<p>Allows a chronomancer to timeport to Point Zero.</p><p>You have studied the chronomancy there and have been granted a special portal spell to teleport back.</p><p>This spell must be kept secret; it should never be used within view of uninitiated witnesses.</p><p>The spell takes time (40 turns) to activate, and you must be out of sight of any other creature when you cast it and when the timeportation takes effect.</p>